    description: "SPLIT from WI-moloj-modig-rimav-zazud-vikiv-sufiv-pohus-sibav part 2 (owner-approved 2026-11-01, P3 review at dev 100b6fbb6e). The chained-call receiver branch types only a call_expression operand whose callee is a function; a type conversion spelled as a call, generic (Map[int](x)) or not (Plain(x)), is not recognised as producing a value of that type, so .Foo()/.Bar() fall to the generic guards (external 0.4). Review fixture: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/ (WI-moloj's batch). Siblings: WI-moloj (value arms), WI-jojam (generic-receiver method naming)."  # bee2
